WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.701
The first decimal place is tenths, next is hundredths and next is thousandths.

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:13.811
In 0.929, which digit occupies the tenths place? The answer is 9. 0.929 has digit 9

00:00:13.811 --> 00:00:15.880
in its tenths place.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:22.323
A measurement on a football field is 0.211 m. Which digit is in the thousandths

00:00:22.323 --> 00:00:24.572
place? Pause the video and think.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:31.804
A measurement on a football field is 0.211 m. Which digit is in the thousandths

00:00:31.804 --> 00:00:37.311
place? The answer is 1. 0.211 has digit 1 in its thousandths place.
